"How long the wire rests between one full pass — sweep, browse, knock — and the next. Shorter keeps the pressure continuous; longer revisits on a slower, quieter cadence. While the wire stays quiet the rest stretches itself, up to ten minutes, and snaps back the moment a pass finds something." = "ワイヤーが1回の完全なパス — 掃引、巡回、ノック — と次のパスの間にどれだけ休むか。短いほど漂流は小さく保たれ、バッテリーとあなた自身の常時放射が増える。";
