"While watching, the /24 is re-swept on the sweep port and Bonjour is diffed — joinings, leavings, openings stream in here. Only what this phone can observe itself; nothing is intercepted." = "見張りの間、/24は掃引ポートで再掃引され、Bonjourは差分を取られる — 参加、退出、ポートの開きが出来事として届く。";
