"Foreign hands were only ever known in the small hours (%lld:00–%lld:00) — but a cadence flag landed at %@. The habit is broken, or new hands have arrived." = "よその手は未明(%lld:00–%lld:00)にしか知られていなかった——だがケイデンスフラグが %@ に落ちた。習慣が破れたか、新しい手が来たか。";
"Foreign hands were only ever known on weekdays — but a cadence flag landed on a weekend, at %@. The habit is broken, or new hands have arrived." = "よその手は平日にしか知られていなかった——だがケイデンスフラグが週末の %@ に落ちた。習慣が破れたか、新しい手が来たか。";
"Hands that were not the usual hands" = "いつもの手ではない手";
"Heart-rate variability read %lld ms against your own fortnight baseline of %lld ms — the nervous system's ledger, read against itself. Strain, short sleep, and coming illness all write in it. A correlation, printed as one — not a cause." = "心拍変動は %lld ms。あなたの2週間の基準値は %lld ms——神経系の帳簿を、それ自身に照らして読んだもの。負荷、短い睡眠、近づく体調不良、そのすべてがここに書き込む。相関として記す——原因ではない。";
"I can't crown a router on this wire yet — the gateway didn't read and no neighbor carries router signs. A Net-Assault pass and a minute of the watch would give me the evidence." = "この回線ではまだルーターに王冠を渡せない——ゲートウェイが読めず、近隣のどれもルーターの兆しを持たない。Net-Assault を一巡させ、見張りを1分置けば、証拠が手に入る。";
"Its rhythm says around %@. A forecast, printed as one — if it does not come, the absence finding will have something to stand on." = "そのリズムは %@ あたりを示している。予測として記す——来なければ、不在の所見に立つ足場ができる。";
